P00519 — Tyrosine-protein Kinase ABL1 (ABL1 — Homo sapiens)
Description: A non-receptor tyrosine kinase involved in cell growth, survival, and cytoskeleton remodeling; famously involved in the $BCR\text{-}ABL1$ fusion gene in Chronic Myeloid Leukemia (CML).
Best for: Kinase domain annotations, active/inactive catalytic state comparisons, and targeted drug design pipelines (e.g., Imatinib binding site).
